- **⭐🔴 UNDEPLOYED FIXES** (need a worker rebuild + fleet restart): `a474d01d` market retry 5→24 tries / 15s busy_timeout — fixes chronic 4-6/min lost marketbot captures [[reference_market_db_prune]] · `2114df0e` MaxRestarts=100 parks an agent forever [[reference_crash_loop_cap_parks_agents_forever]] · `6635aa73` settled-mission livelock, 30 cleared by hand [[reference_settled_mission_livelock]]. **UNPUSHED: `a474d01d`, `5e9a4e1b`.**
