## Data Loss / Capture Gaps
- **⭐🔴 85 of 223 memory files are NOT referenced in this index** (2026-08-29) — an unindexed memory is unrecallable, so it gets re-derived, often WRONG. `project_assist_fleet_refueling_pump_gap` held the built-in-pump fact since 08-15 and was re-derived badly on 08-29. Same shape as the 18 empty tables: the artifact exists, nothing wires it in.
- **⭐🔴 [Six ways we silently drop data](reference_capture_loss_taxonomy.md)** — **18 KB tables have NEVER held a row**; every mode looks identical to success. Detector spec'd, NOT built.
- **⭐🔴 [Stale status files read as LIVE](reference_fleet_status_fossil.md)** — `fleet-status.json` 17 days dead was the "legacy binary workers"; retired `3743e471`. `mining-status.json` is in the same state now.

## Fleet Ops — Live Problems (2026-08-29)
- **⭐🔴 [Stronghold guard is re-written per role](reference_stronghold_guard_is_per_role.md)** — implemented 5x, **ABSENT from assist/autopilot/hunt/explore/freight**. Only haul.go is standing-aware. **8 of 24 losses were locked agents at strongholds.** Fix = one gate in the movement layer.
- **⭐ [Tankers have a BUILT-IN refuel pump](project_assist_fleet_refueling_pump_gap.md)** — no module needed (proven 08-15, Capacity gave +420 to salvager-10). Also: the claim election is **pump-blind**, and `assistPendingAge` reads `requested_at` so an old record **defeats distance routing entirely**. Tanker tiers/hulls per empire listed there.
- **⭐🔴 [no_fuel_cells ≠ no_fuel_source](project_no_fuel_cells_refuel_deadlock.md)** — credits do NOT fix a `no_fuel_cells` worker; leading cause is the station having no refuel SERVICE. The worker never buys fuel cells and retries forever.
- **⭐🔴 [The refuelling fleet is itself dry](reference_assist_fleet_is_dry.md)** — 3 of 5 assist tankers immobile; **assist-sol lost its Tanker in Lawless algol and has been invisible 14 days at 0 fuel / 2 credits**. Tankers dispense from the TANK — `cargo_used: 0` is normal. 10k-12k tankers exist unbought.
- **⭐🔴 [Off-map == QUARANTINED, never launched](reference_rescue_queue_blocks_launch.md)** — `restoreQuarantine` precedes the supervisor, so `restarts:0` + zero `last_seen`. **trader-1 sits healthy on a FULL tank and still held.** Two POIs are fuel traps.
- **Pirate unlock: 45/161. The bottleneck is NOMINATION** — 101 locked agents were never nominated; 6 finished agents still pinned in the pool wasting slots. Rotation itself works (15 haulers graduated and returned).
- **Haul fleet: cargo capacity is NOT the binding constraint** — r=+0.27 between hold size and profit/haul; a 60-cargo shard out-earns an 850-cargo junk_convoy. **Do not re-equip before fixing routing.**
- **Freight: 3 prime carriers = 85% of delivered value.** Shipping earned **22.1M** (market.db `freight_results.carrier_payout`) vs 8.9M from ALL missions; the action log does NOT record freight payouts.

## Performance / Host Load
- [Worker DB pool cap = NEGATIVE RESULT](reference_worker_db_pool_negative_result.md) — didn't cut CPU; don't retry. (Real culprit: unindexed GetReferenceAsk.)
- **pkg/worker pre-commit race gate times out at its internal 300s under fleet load** — not a code defect; user-approved `--no-verify` + substitute gate (build / lint / targeted tests / scoped `-race`).

