## Combat & Fitting
- **⭐ [Module wear/repair REMOVED](reference_module_wear_removed.md)** — refitting is consequence-free now; unblocks re-equipping the 29 agents on starters against 170 idle hulls. `get_ship` takes `ship_id`; `list_ships` returns `module_type_ids`.
- **⭐🔴 [Combat damage pipeline](reference_combat_damage_pipeline.md)** — **adaptive shields gave ZERO damage reduction** (2×III fitted, raw 60 = final 60); they only add shield POOL. `brace` = 0.25 damage but **0% offense**, so it suits UNARMED hulls only. **`reach` gates firing entirely** — pulse_laser_iii (reach 3) couldn't fire at distance 4. weapons+gunnery additive at 1%/level. The worker has NO combat code; `advance` comes from the SERVER autopilot.
- **⭐ [Module cost scales with Engineering](reference_ship_module_costs_scale_with_engineering.md)** — catalogue CPU/power are BASE, reduced 1%/level. Engineering trains passively only while fitting ≥90% of CPU or Power, so it self-limits. `items.size` has module sizes; `agent_hulls.modules` is a COUNT not a list.

## Gotchas
- **⭐🔴 [get_nearby on arrival reads EMPTY](reference_wildlife_arrival_race.md)** — server tick-ordering race, **18% false-negative** at live POIs; it made the hunt fleet REJECT good grounds. Fixed `238f73a7`. **Coverage table is `wildlife_surveys`, not `wildlife_coverage`.** Remove the play_as workaround when patch notes land.
- [drone_bay is an agent-wide ledger](reference_drone_bay_is_agent_wide.md) — deployed drones keep mining elsewhere across a ship switch; `bay_capacity`/`bandwidth_total` report 0.
- **⭐🔴 [Docked at 0 fuel is invisible to the watchdog](reference_docked_zero_fuel_invisible_to_watchdog.md)** — `Stalled()` early-returns on `Docked`, so a dry station fuel desk stranded 7 agents at grand_exchange that no health check could see. Hand-write a rescue record; it does NOT quarantine.
- **⭐🟢 [Ship-to-ship refuel WORKS dock-to-dock](reference_ship_to_ship_refuel_works_while_docked.md)** — no undocking needed; `rescue_fuel` is a floor not a cap. **The client's fuel field stays 0 after an external refuel** — confirm via `tank_full` or successful jumps, never the status file.
- **⭐ [Jump time + fuel formulas](reference_ship_jump_time_and_fuel_formulas.md)** — `jumpTicks = max(1, 7−speed)`, fuel `ceil(scale^1.5×speed)`. Invalidates every flat per-jump constant; `rescue.FuelPerJump=5` still wrong.
- **⭐🔴 [Standing AT a POI is not being DOCKED](reference_sell_leg_dock_gap.md)** — a RESUMED haul looped `not_docked` forever. FIXED `2fea237a`. · **[Pin-arrival needs FOUR checks](reference_pin_arrival_check_four_directions.md)** — `docked_at_base` is EMPTY while docked ([also](reference_docked_at_base_gotcha.md)) · **[Pinned mission workers never refuel](reference_pinned_mission_workers_never_refuel.md)** — refuelling is a ROLE property; FIXED `topUpAtPin`.
- **⭐ [Rank freight hulls FITTED, not by base stats](reference_prayer_class_freight_hulls.md)** — `cargo_expander_iii` = +100 cargo/slot; slotless Prayer (540) loses to floor_price+1exp (500 at **1** fuel/jump). **congregation = 1900 cargo, tier 1, no piloting — commission it?**
- **⭐ [storeRawJSON key drift](reference_rawjson_key_drift.md)** — cache keys reachable ONLY via the action switch die silently when a reply omits `action`. **Audit the rest.** · **[Legacy mining hulls erased by every catalog refresh](reference_legacy_ship_classes_erased_by_refresh.md)** — `StoreShipClasses` is DELETE+INSERT.
- **⭐ [Player stations can refuse your dock](reference_player_station_access.md)** — access is LEARNED; unverified = closed · **[Station ids are dual-named](reference_station_id_aliases.md)** — joins under-report silently · [Lawless transit is safe; idling is not](reference_lawless_transit_vs_idle.md) · [Ironlight Combine = the dev's faction](reference_ironlight_combine_dev_faction.md)
