- **⭐🔴 [A BOUNTY IS UNPAID TAX](reference_tax_bounties_and_rates.md)** — bounty == the unpaid shortfall EXACTLY; weekly Sunday levy; **Crimson Pact = 10% income / 1% property, 4x Outer Rim**; property tax hits IDLE ships. **[Not from combat](reference_agent_bounties_not_combat.md)** — every 0-credit agent has one. **[Auto-pays on entering the empire's space](reference_bounty_auto_pays_on_entering_territory.md)** — the trap is 0 credits→no fuel→stranded.
